  "system_changes": "None. Existing repository .venv only; no dependencies installed.",
  "implementation": [
    "PagedPool caches detached compute-dtype slabs; FP32 parameters, gradients and optimizer state remain unchanged.",
    "Each dispatch uses an independent autograd edge converting its contribution to the master dtype before accumulation. Sharing a differentiable BF16 cast is explicitly rejected by an adversarial regression.",
    "Cast generations are replaced rather than overwritten. Activation checkpoint inputs bind their original generation.",
    "Optimizer hooks and slot loads invalidate. Parameter identities, storage pointers, versions, shape/stride/device/dtype and slot mapping guard reuse. Module moves release old storage; state_dict assignment/replacement is covered.",
    "External unversioned in-place .data edits must call pool.invalidate(). Cache is runtime-only and does not change checkpoint formats.",
    "FP32 compute bypasses caching. pool.cache_training_weights=False restores cast-per-use training for A/B tests; profiler exposes --no-weight-cache."
  ],
